  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "R0070",
      "line": 70,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "1. 创建一个系统。",
      "source_sha256": "4320abfb94843978d9616bc0e461c62cbc42d8b4555631e69f9e3cdc6393257a",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0071",
      "line": 71,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "2. 创建一个**模块组**（运行态顶栏导航分组）。",
      "source_sha256": "21cc8a1431493aa77cb96489f487cd6f1d35da018ffb9e7b80c0935f319bb48b",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0072",
      "line": 72,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "3. 在模块组下创建业务模块。",
      "source_sha256": "ea89fdc69fee8e598b6f8ebd5b02fbdd6c4666b6e1231df683031a011add85df",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0073",
      "line": 73,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "4. 配置字段。",
      "source_sha256": "d4c1024b2e6f8eb7affa73bd8c7d1b3f5c49bc8c616d7e88e7b1fb4f92059421",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0074",
      "line": 74,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "5. 配置页面动作（含导出）。",
      "source_sha256": "faa34a6fb0f2092ecbd48b6638783268d18b5a8437b35d2e8b5467e62cc429bf",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0075",
      "line": 75,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "6. 配置菜单与发布。",
      "source_sha256": "62d3f9d75c3a13e54e03283bba0490191c7b47602f449b49458344799cf959ac",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0076",
      "line": 76,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "7. 配置角色权限。",
      "source_sha256": "7a023cfc831fbccbdf4ca0f81f4fbddb59ab70f642669a2344bf54a24b02b9ed",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0077",
      "line": 77,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "8. 配置审批流程。",
      "source_sha256": "707692315d00d5931b53c3fb758b9d8603f3489fa39741c53f11952aa485d358",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0078",
      "line": 78,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "9. （可选）配置应用的外部访问或系统内访问入口。",
      "source_sha256": "3ff8a0923cf2638a8b973a16360ab357ee22638ce4354bfac92cabee86960b50",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0079",
      "line": 79,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "10. 邀请用户使用。",
      "source_sha256": "71b669502b546a54defd26b4f4fbb80467b407c71c23ecc6cd3d515c19fbfc70",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0080",
      "line": 80,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "11. 导出数据或开放接口。",
      "source_sha256": "9dd3ec8490afd629e31b4e7d7e4776e70e30fb51128ed9575c857862939be093",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0082",
      "line": 82,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "> **统一边界：** 建模主链是“系统 → 模块组 → 模块”，不是“应用 → 模块”。应用用于提供外部访问和系统内受控访问，见 4.2、5.3 和附录 A。",
      "source_sha256": "2e77b05c6942acde155bb5480b1adf9ed1a6986857af5c7e34c226569dcf0141",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0084",
      "line": 84,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "普通用户应该可以完成：",
      "source_sha256": "876195a85385077beac6c8d02e97968f5875e4deb24a37fafd383c346c947a1e",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0086",
      "line": 86,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "1. 登录。",
      "source_sha256": "a8d7a0d8ebc31b9112b57e9a90ee737ff496b52eaa129d52f04f0b08c78ba85e",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0087",
      "line": 87,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "2. 进入自己有权限的系统。",
      "source_sha256": "4ed37e72946a3347da7ac4866f4207945cb15c768b00caa11e13d6a46136360d",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0088",
      "line": 88,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "3. 打开业务菜单。",
      "source_sha256": "6679bdd9d141744d9a31bf19a3137cce597fbaf30d9d25735d4a942be426d945",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0089",
      "line": 89,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "4. 新增和编辑数据。",
      "source_sha256": "04cb34324936b582224390c0e437b3842e0274e1409545619c3adfb33aef2f22",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0090",
      "line": 90,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "5. 查询和筛选数据。",
      "source_sha256": "ac7ed0e869816e4de25f572b8da38e8f691e08edc37578693fb7ff0e65c74652",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0091",
      "line": 91,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "6. 查看详情。",
      "source_sha256": "44fd66d29c46d6c509a28f7c041fc6f226ae8ba0a55d12d1d26269fee8d0d8b3",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0092",
      "line": 92,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "7. 上传附件。",
      "source_sha256": "5c93bddf6e68dcf7c40372c8af2e1a33f6568202d1a3498b19cacf3942b7bd5f",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0093",
      "line": 93,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "8. 处理审批。",
      "source_sha256": "4b4972270ce4381434fbaa306731075cebb7a66c05dd67c7e22db16934138b82",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0094",
      "line": 94,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "9. 查看消息。",
      "source_sha256": "5cee1e629f5fee684947e11696c2e42f1192c6fecfe495096cfa480513d9b5a9",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R0095",
      "line": 95,
      "section": "2.3",
      "excerpt": "10. 导出自己有权限的数据。",
      "source_sha256": "6efb0ac630a3e4400f9627dd70403b666baa5cd5e175168fbb8c9f9cb99e6634",
      "status": "verified_contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "R2958",
      "line": 2958,
      "section": "A.18",
      "excerpt": "- 固定平台能力的物理表在完整需求和业务关系梳理后一次设计成型。表结构定稿、空库验证完成后，先运行工程框架的 Base 代码生成，再适配 manage 业务代码和接口；不以反复追加局部表、反复生成 Base 代替整体设计。",
      "source_sha256": "a8187fa0ae09824eb777ab49cfef6d7dd2e2cd7fc32faa8d3160babe8fdcfc78",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R2959",
      "line": 2959,
      "section": "A.18",
      "excerpt": "- 业务表不设置外键和触发器。表之间保存明确的关联标识并按需要建立查询索引；关联对象的存在性、归属范围、权限、状态和变更规则由业务服务校验与处理。主键、必要的唯一键及字段类型等单表结构仍用于稳定存储和并发安全。",
      "source_sha256": "28553e7520deefa9969b5552eba55630491c70b033a46b061488ff7fbcfd8178",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R2961",
      "line": 2961,
      "section": "A.18",
      "excerpt": "- 用户创建的业务模块仍由模块、字段、发布版本、主记录、字段值、索引、关联和子表等公共表定义，不按每个自定义模块另建物理表。接口返回当前有权使用的已发布字段、字段类型、字段配置和页面配置，前端据此构建列表、表单和详情；服务端依据同一配置校验、保存、查询和流转业务数据。",
      "source_sha256": "89bc3b089b66e0331dbbd56bc756b68ebed15f5ee71110f012a16a3e6f408575",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R2967",
      "line": 2967,
      "section": "A.19",
      "excerpt": "- **统一表名**：所有产品业务表以 `un_` 开头，随后体现所属业务域。平台表使用 `un_plat_*`，系统表使用 `un_sys_*`，Flow 表使用 `un_flow_*`；授权、审计、配置、通用业务数据、基础控制、后台任务、应用、工作、通知、AI、文件、数据交换、分析、打印、运维等分别沿用清晰的所属业务域，形成 `un_auth_*`、`un_audit_*`、`un_cfg_*`、`un_biz_*`、`un_core_*`、`un_job_*`、`un_app_*`、`un_work_*`、`un_msg_*`／`un_todo_*`、`un_ai_*`、`un_file_*`、`un_exchange_*`、`un_ana_*`、`un_print_*`、`un_ops_*`。平台层待办和消息仍归 `un_plat_*`。表名与 Java 模块归属、Base 生成配置保持一致，不保留新旧双表或别名兼容层。",
      "source_sha256": "6fb1713c36a17ea641310618ba95e493b44adc059c587c85f1b3fac632b0cb86",
      "status": "unverified"
    },
    {
      "id": "R2968",
      "line": 2968,
      "section": "A.19",
      "excerpt": "- **SQL 文件**：首装表结构按后端代码模块拆分源 SQL，一个模块的当前最终建表定义集中维护；不继续按历史局部修补累积首装文件。工程工具确定性生成 `db/init.sql`、`db/update.sql`、`db/final.sql`：`init.sql` 是首装基线，`update.sql` 是基线冻结后增量更新，`final.sql` 是从空库得到当前最终结构的完整执行链。当前只有测试数据，可在隔离库清库重建并重新生成 Base，不为旧测试数据做迁移；以后如有真实数据，则按变更性质提供迁移方案。",
      "source_sha256": "eddc591344a8fc58c713e137020093bf6e0f8e38d1c154553ccef246ec53eab6",
      "status": "unverified"
    }
  ]
}
